THIRD-PARTY / BUNDLED COMPONENTS

The MIT license above covers the code of this package (the Rust shim in `shim/`
and the Chuks surface in `src/`). The prebuilt shim library additionally bundles
FFmpeg, compiled from source and statically linked:

  FFmpeg (libavformat, libavcodec, libavutil, libswscale, libswresample,
  libavfilter) — licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
  version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later). https://www.ffmpeg.org

This package is built in FFmpeg's default LGPL configuration and does NOT enable
any GPL or non-free components (e.g. libx264, libx265, GPL filters). Distributing
a binary that includes the prebuilt shim therefore carries LGPL obligations for
the FFmpeg portion: you must allow recipients to relink against a modified FFmpeg
(e.g. by shipping the FFmpeg source used and the means to rebuild the shim, which
this repository provides) and reproduce the notice above. See the README's
"Licensing" section for details.
